  "prefLabel": "Agr 4101.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 4101.01 Purpose. This rule implements the animal records database created by RSA 437:8-a, which directs the department of agriculture, markets, and food to establish and contract with a third party for the implementation and operation of an electronic system to facilitate the handling of animal records.\n\nSource. #14163, eff 1-7-25",
